# Treasury Environment Variables

## Database
TREASURY_DB_PATH=./data/treasury.db

## Payment Provider
# Set to 'binance' to use real Binance Agentic Wallet (baw CLI)
# Set to 'mock' (default) — used for Judge Demo and development
TREASURY_PAYMENT_MODE=mock

# Path to baw CLI (default: 'baw' — must be in PATH)
BAW_CLI_PATH=baw

## Blockchain / Payment
# BSC Mainnet only — testnet not verified with BAW
TREASURY_WALLET_CHAIN_ID=56

# First verified route: BSC mainnet USDT contract. Route validation remains authoritative.
TREASURY_PAYMENT_TOKEN=0x55d398326f99059fF775485246999027B3197955

## Real Payment Proof
# Required for real Binance payment verification.
# Must be a valid EVM address (0x + 40 hex chars).
# Leave empty = real proof NOT_CONFIGURED.
# TREASURY_REAL_PROOF_RECIPIENT=0x...

## Security
# Never commit real credentials to repo
# Binance wallet requires human QR scan via: baw auth signin
